{"code":0,"message":"OK","result":{"id":13648,"code":"8e3da806e7c547d9866a1d9cde14694e","type":"outer","hasInner":null,"positionStatusCode":"Release","recruitProjectCode":"schoolr","recruitSubProjectCode":"20271779425607","hcHoldTime":null,"name":"HR-战略招聘","departmentCode":null,"departmentName":null,"businessDirectoryCode":null,"positionClassCode":"3","ifFrontLineEmployee":null,"welfareLabelCode":null,"workingHoursNature":"1001","positionNatureCode":"fulltime","positionCategoryCode":"function","positionRankCode":null,"positionLevelCode":null,"workLocationCode":null,"recruitNumber":null,"allocateResumeWeight":null,"allocateWaterLevel":null,"headCountUsed":null,"description":"这个岗位要做的事，是面向组织战略布局未来。\n有时候是研究：行业、公司为什么发生变化，背后的人发生了什么；\n有时候是判断：一个人现在不会动，但未来可能正是我们需要他的时候；\n有时候是建立信任：在对方还不知道自己要离开的时候；\n战略招聘做的，是在招聘发生之前很久就把事情想清楚。\n\n【工作内容】\n1、根据公司战略，持续拓展高阶人才的供给通道，主动建立与关键人才的连接，为各业务做前瞻性人才储备；\n2、深入研究国内外标杆公司的业务演变、组织变化和人才流动，提炼行业洞察，为战略招聘决策提供真实依据；\n3、关注新兴赛道，探索适合公司阶段的人才甄选方法论，持续输出有效的招聘策略和人才规划。\n\n【对 AI 的期待】\n你应该已经在用 AI 处理信息密集型的工作：行业研究、人才图谱整理、竞对动态追踪。我们希望你不只是\"会用\"，而是真的用 AI 把自己的判断速度和研究深度拉到一个新层级。","positionDemand":"1、对公司和行业有真实好奇心，能从信息里读出别人忽略的信号；\n2、能在模糊中形成判断，并且愿意承担它；\n3、擅长与人建立信任关系，能跟高阶人才进行真正意义上的对话；\n4、有耐心做长线，不会因为一个结果迟迟未到就失去节奏感；\n5、真正用起 AI 工具——从第一天开始，而不是“以后再说”；\n6、本科及以上，有招聘或互联网相关实习经验优先 。\n","smartResumeConfig":null,"enableIntelligent":null,"recruitLeaderNumber":null,"recruitLeaderName":null,"recruitLeaderUsername":null,"outRelationPositionId":null,"ifParticipateBeisen":null,"evaluateCompanyCode":null,"evaluateProjectCode":null,"writeExamType":null,"ifShowRecruitWebsite":true,"ifShowRecommendWebsite":true,"ifRecruitWebsiteHot":null,"ifRecommendWebsiteHot":null,"finalInterviewerCode":null,"auditStartUser":null,"auditStartTime":null,"positionAuditProcessId":null,"businessAuditTemplateCode":null,"auditTemplateCode":null,"offerAuditProcessId":null,"pauseTime":null,"releaseTime":"2026-08-12 21:38:33","closeTime":null,"closeUserId":null,"positionLabel":null,"updateTime":1789700985000,"recruiterScreenEv